1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,007
What if gravity flipped every time your phone buzzed?

2
00:00:04,047 --> 00:00:07,303
You are happily eating a sandwich in the park.

3
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:07,661
Bzzt.

4
00:00:07,701 --> 00:00:10,169
And suddenly, the sky is the floor.

5
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:12,804
Gravity flips again at the café.

6
00:00:12,844 --> 00:00:14,656
Cups rocket to the ceiling,

7
00:00:14,696 --> 00:00:18,084
chairs follow, and the barista calmly asks whether

8
00:00:18,124 --> 00:00:20,964
anyone wants to keep their oat milk latte.

9
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:23,427
Then the group chat wakes up.

10
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:26,486
Twenty-three notifications, each one a flip.

11
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:27,807
Up, down, up again.

12
00:00:27,847 --> 00:00:30,658
You become a very confused pinball with a

13
00:00:30,698 --> 00:00:31,771
very full inbox.

14
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,272
On the highway it gets worse.

15
00:00:34,312 --> 00:00:36,619
Cars float up like startled fish.

16
00:00:36,659 --> 00:00:39,534
Drivers wave, hold their steering wheels,

17
00:00:39,574 --> 00:00:42,023
and admit that this is a bad moment

18
00:00:42,063 --> 00:00:43,303
to receive a text.

19
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:45,982
You switch on airplane mode.

20
00:00:46,022 --> 00:00:48,657
Great idea, except everyone else didn't.

21
00:00:48,697 --> 00:00:50,797
So you hug a lamp post while the

22
00:00:50,837 --> 00:00:54,542
whole town flips, and ten thousand phones sing together.

23
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:57,897
Physicists would call this pure fiction,

24
00:00:57,937 --> 00:01:00,225
since a phone cannot change gravity.

25
00:01:00,265 --> 00:01:02,036
But as a thought experiment,

26
00:01:02,076 --> 00:01:05,658
a flipping vector would make every day a roller coaster.

27
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:07,145
Then the twist.

28
00:01:07,185 --> 00:01:09,215
Your battery hits one percent,

29
00:01:09,255 --> 00:01:10,526
and the phone dies.

30
00:01:10,566 --> 00:01:11,905
Nobody can text you.

31
00:01:11,945 --> 00:01:13,975
Gravity stays flipped forever,

32
00:01:14,015 --> 00:01:17,011
and the whole town is now living on the sky.

33
00:01:18,050 --> 00:01:20,621
So everyone learns to walk on clouds,

34
00:01:20,661 --> 00:01:22,245
plug in their chargers,

35
00:01:22,285 --> 00:01:24,291
and keep their phones nearby.

36
00:01:24,331 --> 00:01:27,044
Now nobody dares to send you a message.

37
00:01:27,084 --> 00:01:28,314
Not even your mum.
